### Create First Story
POST {{url}}/stories
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "College",
  "subtitle": "An epic tale of discovery",
  "content": "This chapter covers the 3 years of my life in college",
  "startDate": "2023-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-15",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

###

### Create Second Story
POST {{url}}/stories
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Years in China",
  "subtitle": "A cultural awakening",
  "content": "Living abroad transformed my perspective on life, community, and the art of storytelling through everyday connections.",
  "startDate": "2026-03-10",
  "endDate": "2026-08-20",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

###

### Get Story By ID (ID: 1)
GET {{url}}/stories/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Stories for User
GET {{url}}/stories
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Story (ID: 2)
DELETE {{url}}/stories/2
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Story (ID: 1)
PUT {{url}}/stories/1
Authorization:{{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Chronicles of the West (Expanded Edition)",
  "subtitle": "An updated epic tale of discovery",
  "content": "This is the newly revised body text of the story detailing expanded adventures, key milestones, and reflections.",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-20",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

